            "n": null,
            "t": "verse",
            "text": "oṁ tac chaṁyorā-vṛṇīmahe ¦ gātuṁ yajñāya । \ngātuṁ yajña pataye  daivī svastira-stu naḥ । \nsvastir mānuṣebhyaḥ ¦ ūrdhvañ jigātu bheṣajam । \nśan no ¦ astu dvi pade  śañ catuṣ pade ॥\noṁ śāntiś śāntiś śāntiḥ ॥",
            "translation": {
              "en": "Oṁ, we crave that peace and well-being. Good for the offering. Good for the offeror. Divine prosperity to us all. Prosperity to mankind. May there be rise in healing. Peace among the bipeds (humans). Peace among the quadrupeds (animals). Oṁ, peace, peace, peace."
            },
